WEBVTT

01:53.240 --> 01:54.440
Mei Lin!

01:58.320 --> 02:00.240
Are you hurt?
Do you have any other injuries?

02:00.320 --> 02:03.280
Prince Heir, you don't have to worry.

02:03.360 --> 02:04.960
I was just blinded by white moths.

02:05.040 --> 02:07.600
It's my fault for being late. Let's go.

02:43.280 --> 02:44.600
Don't worry, Prince Heir.

02:44.680 --> 02:45.800
Princess Heir's blindness is temporary.

02:45.880 --> 02:49.400
The moth's wing dust poisoned her eyes.

02:49.480 --> 02:51.800
Luckily, we applied medicine in the cave.

02:52.760 --> 02:54.960
Later, with some hot compresses,

02:55.040 --> 02:56.320
her sight will fully recover.

02:58.480 --> 02:59.320
Oh,

02:59.920 --> 03:03.040
this cloth band must be changed
every half incense time.

03:03.120 --> 03:05.160
Otherwise, the effect will wear off

03:05.240 --> 03:07.840
and her recovery will be greatly delayed.

03:08.920 --> 03:09.760
Rest assured, Prince Heir.

03:09.840 --> 03:12.280
I will watch over her all night
and change her cloth band.

03:13.600 --> 03:15.880
I'll take care of her. You may leave.

04:18.399 --> 04:20.160
Prince Heir, I've uncovered

04:20.240 --> 04:22.880
that the mine incident was Mingju's doing.

04:25.880 --> 04:28.120
Mingju dared harm the Princess Heir!

04:29.600 --> 04:30.880
Summon the High Priest.

04:31.960 --> 04:33.000
Yes.

04:48.680 --> 04:50.080
Your Majesty.

04:50.160 --> 04:53.800
Once trade resumes,
Xiyan's merchants will profit greatly,

04:53.880 --> 04:57.880
and we could build three more
Towers of Immortality.

05:06.880 --> 05:08.320
What is this strange wind?

05:17.720 --> 05:19.080
Your Majesty, it's the divine prophecy.

05:23.520 --> 05:26.000
"The dark sun is rising in the north.

05:26.080 --> 05:28.960
The fire won't go out.

05:30.440 --> 05:32.600
It will cover the old days

05:32.680 --> 05:35.080
and replace them."

05:37.360 --> 05:40.360
What does this prophecy mean?

05:50.800 --> 05:52.840
It's the sign of Mars guarding the heart.

05:53.680 --> 05:55.480
Your Majesty, Mars signifies rebellion.

05:55.560 --> 05:57.160
The Heart constellation
represents the emperor.

05:57.240 --> 06:01.920
Mars guarding the heart is an omen
of great misfortune,

06:02.000 --> 06:04.280
foretelling defeat
and the fall of the ruler.

06:10.760 --> 06:13.440
The dark sun is rising in the north.

06:14.280 --> 06:15.120
North.

06:16.920 --> 06:17.880
Mingju.

06:18.680 --> 06:21.440
Your Majesty. This is no ordinary omen.

06:23.800 --> 06:28.960
Order Mingju to transfer half his troops
to the Prince Heir's command

06:29.040 --> 06:31.960
for building the Tower of Immortality.

06:33.160 --> 06:34.000
Yes.

07:19.560 --> 07:20.400
Prince Heir.

07:25.720 --> 07:28.440
Mei Lin, you're awake! Can you see?

07:29.040 --> 07:30.480
I can see now.

07:32.000 --> 07:34.320
Thank you for taking care of me.

07:39.040 --> 07:42.680
Did you find out
who caused the mine explosion?

07:42.760 --> 07:44.360
Mingju sent people to do it.

07:44.440 --> 07:47.200
Mingju? He plotted against you?

07:47.280 --> 07:48.840
Don't worry.

07:48.920 --> 07:51.600
I've set a trap with the High Priest
to deal with Mingju.

07:52.680 --> 07:55.520
Just now, my father sent word.

07:55.600 --> 07:57.040
He summoned me urgently back to Xiyan.

07:57.120 --> 07:58.720
I'll return with you, Prince Heir.

07:58.800 --> 07:59.800
You can't.

07:59.880 --> 08:01.840
Border trade between our nations
has just begun.

08:01.920 --> 08:04.600
One of us must stay in Qingzhou.

08:04.680 --> 08:08.400
Mingju failed once. He might try again.

08:08.480 --> 08:11.720
My father has likely punished him,

08:12.400 --> 08:14.240
so for now, he won't act against me.

08:14.320 --> 08:15.680
- Prince Heir.
- Relax.

08:15.760 --> 08:19.320
While I'm away, take care of yourself.

08:19.400 --> 08:22.120
If anything happens, send a pigeon.

08:23.160 --> 08:24.560
You must be careful as well.

08:27.920 --> 08:29.080
Let's go take a look.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.640
- How much is this?
- Five wen.

08:30.720 --> 08:32.600
- And this one?
- Also five wen.

08:33.280 --> 08:34.120
Then I'll take this one.

08:34.200 --> 08:35.480
Xiyan goods are good.

08:36.080 --> 08:38.360
This sachet is great
for repelling insects.

08:38.440 --> 08:39.520
When I went into the mine last time,

08:39.600 --> 08:42.440
after hanging these up,
the bugs all disappeared.

08:42.520 --> 08:44.800
- How much for this?
- Five wen.

08:44.880 --> 08:46.280
- Shopkeeper, could you make it cheaper?
- I wanted to.

08:46.360 --> 08:48.520
Your wife shortchanged me last time.

08:48.600 --> 08:50.800
I'm not the shopkeeper,
and she's not my wife.

08:50.880 --> 08:52.760
You only got a discount
because you bought three.

08:52.840 --> 08:53.960
Buy more

08:54.040 --> 08:56.360
and I'll reduce it by one coin each.

08:56.440 --> 08:58.800
Your wife drives a hard bargain.

08:58.880 --> 09:00.760
- Princess Heir, you're finally here!
- Alright, I'll take a look around.

09:00.840 --> 09:02.880
How are your eyes? Are you okay?

09:03.560 --> 09:04.640
Much better after the medicine.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.240
That's good.

09:06.920 --> 09:07.840
That's silly.

09:08.720 --> 09:09.960
So silly.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.160
Thanks to you and the Prince Heir,

09:14.240 --> 09:15.600
most of the poison bugs are gone,

09:15.680 --> 09:17.720
and business here is booming.

09:17.800 --> 09:19.080
Smell this.

09:24.240 --> 09:25.520
Your sachet recipe is very effective.

09:26.880 --> 09:30.040
Our incense shop's business
is sure to flourish.

09:30.920 --> 09:33.000
Jia wanted to thank you,

09:33.080 --> 09:36.080
but the Prince Heir said
it would disturb your rest.

09:36.800 --> 09:39.560
The Prince Heir is devoted to you now.

09:39.640 --> 09:41.080
I've been worried about your injury.

09:41.160 --> 09:44.440
I even prayed for your recovery yesterday.

09:45.120 --> 09:47.160
I didn't know you believed in such things.

09:47.240 --> 09:49.760
It's been a rough time.

09:49.840 --> 09:50.840
You hurt your eyes.

09:50.920 --> 09:53.200
The governor was even hit by rocks
thrown by the townspeople.

09:53.280 --> 09:54.800
Why did you step on me?

09:54.880 --> 09:56.360
You deserve it.

09:56.440 --> 09:58.560
- Praying won't help them.
- If it weren't for those villagers,

09:58.640 --> 10:00.480
the governor wouldn't have been hurt.

10:00.560 --> 10:02.560
He's a good official,

10:02.640 --> 10:04.320
but they won't believe it.

10:05.080 --> 10:06.880
They won't even give him a name list.

10:06.960 --> 10:08.240
Especially that old stonemason.

10:08.320 --> 10:11.200
He's like a stone in the latrine.
Stinky and stubborn.

10:11.840 --> 10:12.960
Stinky and stubborn.

10:14.040 --> 10:15.160
Yi, smell this.

10:17.160 --> 10:20.120
WINE

10:26.920 --> 10:30.320
Hey-ho, hey-ho

10:30.400 --> 10:33.000
The mountains are full of red

10:33.840 --> 10:37.080
Hey-ho, hey-ho

10:37.160 --> 10:40.200
The cave is full of treasures

10:40.280 --> 10:43.360
Hey-ho, hey-ho

10:43.440 --> 10:46.320
Full of strength

10:46.880 --> 10:49.840
Hey-ho, hey-ho

10:49.920 --> 10:52.680
Returned with treasures

11:01.720 --> 11:03.280
This is an old tune

11:03.360 --> 11:07.800
miners used to pass messages
in the dark caves.

11:08.480 --> 11:10.720
How does a young girl like you know it?

11:11.520 --> 11:12.480
Uncle Li.

11:18.640 --> 11:19.640
Are you…?

11:19.720 --> 11:22.760
Mei the stonemason's daughter, Mei Lin.

11:26.320 --> 11:27.680
The Mei family's daughter?

11:28.280 --> 11:30.960
Little Mei! You've grown so much!

11:32.160 --> 11:33.840
Come on.

11:33.920 --> 11:35.520
Sit down.

11:35.600 --> 11:36.960
Take a seat.

11:40.480 --> 11:42.080
The taverns on Water Street.

11:44.160 --> 11:47.320
Father loved to come here after work.

11:48.320 --> 11:49.280
Indeed.

11:50.240 --> 11:52.160
Whenever the taverns closed,

11:52.800 --> 11:55.280
your mother would bring you along

11:55.360 --> 11:58.520
to pick him up.

11:59.480 --> 12:02.640
Back then, you were only this tall.

12:05.200 --> 12:06.440
Little girl,

12:07.200 --> 12:09.320
do you remember Yun?

12:09.400 --> 12:12.520
She was born the same year as you.

12:13.280 --> 12:14.400
If only…

12:16.360 --> 12:20.200
She should be as tall as you now.

12:23.720 --> 12:24.640
Uncle Li.

12:25.560 --> 12:27.360
Of course, I remember Yun.

12:27.440 --> 12:30.360
Look, there's the bridge.

12:30.440 --> 12:33.280
When we were kids,
we used to play there all the time.

12:37.720 --> 12:41.200
Yun loved to play and eat.

12:41.880 --> 12:43.400
I used to wonder

12:43.480 --> 12:47.760
who would marry such a playful girl.

12:52.880 --> 12:54.040
But…

12:55.360 --> 12:57.360
as her father,

12:58.160 --> 12:59.840
I failed.

13:00.440 --> 13:03.240
I couldn't protect her.

13:13.880 --> 13:17.280
My father was burned alive in front of me.

13:18.320 --> 13:19.760
Not even his bones were left.

13:21.760 --> 13:25.160
I only survived
by crawling out of the mine

13:25.240 --> 13:27.200
where he worked.

13:29.680 --> 13:33.120
I always thought
I survived because I was lucky.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.880
Then I realized

13:35.440 --> 13:37.000
that without the Weibei Army,

13:37.080 --> 13:39.040
I wouldn't have lived.

13:39.120 --> 13:41.560
But they were Qingzhou's enemies!

13:41.640 --> 13:43.680
Weibei Army was wronged.

13:45.120 --> 13:48.280
Our true enemy was Crown Prince
Murong Xuanlie.

13:49.440 --> 13:51.360
We've avenged ourselves.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.920
I saw it!

13:53.000 --> 13:55.160
The Weibei Army started the fire.

13:55.240 --> 13:56.240
Girl,

13:57.040 --> 13:59.000
don't be fooled by mass murderer's lies.

13:59.080 --> 14:01.160
Those weren't real Weibei Armies.

14:03.520 --> 14:04.960
Today's governor of Qingzhou

14:05.680 --> 14:07.360
was General Weibei back then.

14:07.880 --> 14:10.960
He ordered that their blades
should never turn against civilians.

14:11.040 --> 14:14.760
He led the army to protect Qingzhou
until the very last moment,

14:14.840 --> 14:16.760
giving us the chance to escape.

14:18.800 --> 14:20.760
The real Weibei Army,

14:20.840 --> 14:22.880
along with the souls of Qingzhou's dead,

14:23.480 --> 14:25.200
are buried in this land.

14:28.240 --> 14:29.160
Over the years,

14:30.880 --> 14:34.120
they've been falsely accused
and cursed by the people,

14:34.920 --> 14:37.160
but they are Qingzhou's true heroes.

14:40.720 --> 14:44.200
Did he send you to say all this?

14:47.440 --> 14:50.440
I'm speaking for the deceased of Qingzhou.

14:52.760 --> 14:53.600
Uncle Li.

14:54.480 --> 14:57.720
With the monument
and the names carved on it,

14:57.800 --> 14:59.800
they can find their way home.

15:01.240 --> 15:02.880
Yun can come home, too.

15:06.480 --> 15:08.640
Mr. Li! The mass murderer's here again!

15:29.120 --> 15:32.440
Sir, the list for the Monument of
the Masses is only missing Qinglin Lane.

15:38.720 --> 15:40.600
If you want to be a governor of Qingzhou,

15:40.680 --> 15:42.400
you must learn the craft.

16:12.400 --> 16:16.440
Focus on the back half of the chisel
for better control.

16:24.360 --> 16:27.600
Long cuts like this can be angled.
Strike boldly.

17:00.760 --> 17:03.480
I'll carve the characters,
you write the names.

17:09.119 --> 17:11.440
Qinglin Lane, Qingzhou. He Mu.

17:11.520 --> 17:13.240
Li Yun'er.

17:14.520 --> 17:15.800
Li Jiang'an.

17:19.720 --> 17:20.800
Guo Yu.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.359
Wang Lihua.

17:23.440 --> 17:26.359
WAN YUER, GUO YU, WANG LIHUA
MEI DASHAN, LI WENG, LI DASHI

17:27.319 --> 17:28.560
Mei Dashan.

17:38.160 --> 17:39.120
Liu Chunxi.

17:43.280 --> 17:48.800
MEI DASHAN

17:48.880 --> 17:51.280
QINGLIN LANE, QINGZHOU

17:53.600 --> 17:57.040
‪QINGZHOU

17:57.120 --> 18:01.400
KANGJIAN STREET, XIANGYUN LANE

18:01.480 --> 18:06.080
KANGJIAN STREET, CHANGQING LANE

18:06.160 --> 18:10.440
KINDNESS LANE, KANGJIAN STREET
XIANGYUN LANE, QINGLIN LANE…

18:20.040 --> 18:23.840
Today marks ten years
since the Great Fire of Qingzhou.

18:23.920 --> 18:25.160
Ten years ago,

18:25.960 --> 18:30.400
my family's mistakes
caused a hundred thousand deaths.

18:30.480 --> 18:33.480
Countless souls still cannot find peace.

18:34.280 --> 18:37.400
The Qingzhou massacre
will haunt me for the rest of my life.

18:38.880 --> 18:41.320
Failing to protect the people of Qingzhou

18:42.520 --> 18:43.920
was my greatest failure.

18:46.720 --> 18:49.240
This monument is a reminder

18:49.320 --> 18:51.960
that the Murong family must atone.

18:52.040 --> 18:56.800
I'll never forget the names of those lost

18:56.880 --> 19:01.600
and neither will Qingzhou or Great Yan.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.720
There are still names missing

19:08.480 --> 19:10.320
from this monument.

19:15.440 --> 19:17.760
The Weibei Army

19:18.640 --> 19:19.720
defended Qingzhou

19:19.800 --> 19:22.880
and gave their lives to protect it.
Even though they were slandered,

19:22.960 --> 19:24.680
their blades
never turned against civilians.

19:25.200 --> 19:27.680
Those 13,000 soldiers' names

19:27.760 --> 19:30.160
deserve to be engraved here as well.

19:31.320 --> 19:34.080
All of us must remember their names.

19:34.680 --> 19:36.320
Yes. If it weren't for the Weibei Army,

19:36.400 --> 19:38.160
we'd still be bullied by Xiyan!

19:38.240 --> 19:39.160
They were good men!

19:39.840 --> 19:41.240
The Weibei Army didn't start the fire.

19:41.320 --> 19:42.320
They were wronged!

19:42.400 --> 19:44.520
The Weibei Army never harmed civilians.

19:44.600 --> 19:46.840
- But the civilians betrayed them.
- Right.

19:46.920 --> 19:48.320
She's telling the truth!

19:58.960 --> 20:02.560
Will the Weibei Army
protect Qingzhou again?

20:03.600 --> 20:05.000
The Weibei Army no longer exists.

20:06.160 --> 20:08.160
There's no Weibei Army now.

20:17.000 --> 20:18.800
But as long as you remember them,

20:19.760 --> 20:22.600
then they live on.

20:25.880 --> 20:28.920
I will carry on their legacy

20:30.000 --> 20:31.720
and protect this land.

20:35.880 --> 20:38.200
Qingzhou remembers the Weibei Army.

20:38.280 --> 20:43.720
The Weibei Army lives on!

20:43.800 --> 20:45.360
The Weibei Army lives on!

21:11.840 --> 21:12.680
One!

21:13.800 --> 21:14.640
Two!

21:16.440 --> 21:17.280
Three!

21:18.800 --> 21:19.640
Four!

21:21.040 --> 21:21.880
Five!

21:22.520 --> 21:23.360
Six!

21:24.080 --> 21:25.360
Seven!

21:25.440 --> 21:27.240
Crown Prince Jinghe

21:27.320 --> 21:29.280
from governing Qingzhou

21:29.360 --> 21:32.600
promotes border trade and cuts taxes,

21:32.680 --> 21:34.520
bringing comfort far and wide.

21:34.600 --> 21:36.080
Mines dug deep,

21:36.160 --> 21:37.960
wealth in store,

21:38.040 --> 21:41.200
bridging hearts and minds once more.

21:41.280 --> 21:42.560
Roads and bridges for all to tread.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.440
By his hand, the people led.

21:44.520 --> 21:46.080
Great his deeds, they bring me pride.

21:46.160 --> 21:48.160
To his worth, none can hide.

21:48.240 --> 21:52.640
Thus, the Weibei Army's seal is returned

21:52.720 --> 21:55.920
to Murong Jinghe, and honor is earned.

21:56.000 --> 21:57.640
Rebuild the troops, with flag in hand.

22:06.000 --> 22:07.400
- Porcelain!
- Rock candy hawthorn!

22:07.480 --> 22:09.360
Come look at the porcelain!

22:11.240 --> 22:12.120
Prince Heir.

22:12.200 --> 22:14.000
The Prince Heir is waiting for you
in the council chamber.

22:14.080 --> 22:14.960
The Prince Heir has returned?

22:16.120 --> 22:17.280
Prince Heir.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.440
Princess Heir.

22:25.480 --> 22:29.080
We were sent by the King
to check on the border trade gains.

22:29.880 --> 22:31.240
So, you're from the King?

22:32.200 --> 22:35.400
The tax records from the border trade
are all in order.

22:43.960 --> 22:45.320
Thank you, Princess Heir.

22:45.400 --> 22:46.960
We shall return immediately

22:47.040 --> 22:49.360
to report to the King.

22:52.800 --> 22:53.640
Prince Heir,

22:53.720 --> 22:56.080
the King's Longevity Plan

22:56.800 --> 22:58.560
requires lighting the lamp soon.

22:58.640 --> 23:01.160
He has everything prepared

23:01.240 --> 23:02.480
for tomorrow's climb
to Sun and Moon Kunluns.

23:10.840 --> 23:13.520
Prince Heir, what's the matter?

23:14.120 --> 23:14.960
Mei Lin.

23:15.800 --> 23:17.640
I must ask a favor of you.

23:31.160 --> 23:34.640
The Prince Heir's border trade
has been quite successful.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.920
The profits are substantial,

23:37.880 --> 23:40.080
enough to build

23:40.160 --> 23:42.200
the Tower of Immortality,

23:42.280 --> 23:46.560
but something is missing.

23:46.640 --> 23:51.680
A Longevity Lamp to bless me.

23:53.120 --> 23:57.240
Since Qingzhou is the land
blessed by Xiyan,

23:57.320 --> 24:01.000
I want the Sun and Moon Kunluns
to light the lamp

24:01.920 --> 24:05.800
on Qingzhou's Sacred Mountain for me.

24:08.320 --> 24:09.960
I understand, Father.

24:11.080 --> 24:14.440
Those men were here
to push for the ceremony, right?

24:15.760 --> 24:17.480
If it were just about lighting the lamp,
I wouldn't mind.

24:18.320 --> 24:20.320
We've worked hard
to establish border trade.

24:20.400 --> 24:22.120
Step by step,

24:22.200 --> 24:25.240
we've finally reached prosperity
and even collected some taxes.

24:25.320 --> 24:26.720
But the money,

24:27.320 --> 24:29.480
instead of benefiting the people,

24:29.560 --> 24:31.880
is being used
for the Tower of Immortality.

24:33.920 --> 24:38.600
Is eternal life
really more important than the living?

24:42.880 --> 24:43.720
Prince Heir.

24:45.080 --> 24:47.560
the border trade between nations
is good for Xiyan.

24:47.640 --> 24:48.880
You've done your best.

24:50.080 --> 24:51.200
Trade is booming,

24:51.280 --> 24:56.040
and life in Xiyan will improve too.

25:00.280 --> 25:02.000
Congratulations,
Prince Heir and Princess Heir.

25:03.880 --> 25:07.360
Words from Great Yan.
Concubine Yan is one month pregnant.

25:10.560 --> 25:12.360
This is her letter.

25:20.440 --> 25:23.880
Qin. Mei. I guess you didn't expect it.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.640
I'm going to be a mother!

25:26.400 --> 25:28.800
You must be so happy for me, right?

25:28.880 --> 25:31.920
Are you grinning ear to ear?

25:34.240 --> 25:36.320
Zigu always knows what to say.

25:39.520 --> 25:42.560
But honestly, I'm nervous.

25:43.120 --> 25:46.240
I don't know if I'll be a good mother.

25:46.320 --> 25:51.160
I'm not as calm as my brother
nor as wise as our mother.

25:51.240 --> 25:54.440
The Emperor tried to comfort me
by praying with me.

25:57.160 --> 26:00.960
He said it doesn't matter
if I'm a good mother.

26:01.040 --> 26:04.480
He just wants our child and me
to be safe and content.

26:04.560 --> 26:05.560
I can feel the baby kicking.

26:07.920 --> 26:11.320
What should we name him?

26:12.360 --> 26:15.200
Oh, Mei, I picked out
some wedding gifts for you.

26:16.640 --> 26:18.600
Brother, do you remember?

26:19.520 --> 26:21.040
After Mother passed,

26:21.120 --> 26:24.080
on my birthday, Ziyu made me cry all day.

26:25.040 --> 26:27.840
You made a sled for me to cheer me up.

26:30.040 --> 26:34.120
We played in the mud
and got scolded by Father.

26:34.720 --> 26:38.120
That was the first time
I saw you so happy,

26:39.640 --> 26:41.160
but it was the last time.

26:43.360 --> 26:46.360
Brother always taught me
to follow the rules.

26:47.560 --> 26:49.320
But I now think

26:49.960 --> 26:52.840
those rules are the chains that bind you.

26:53.920 --> 26:55.240
I just want you

26:56.560 --> 27:00.120
to live as freely as you did that day.

27:19.320 --> 27:20.920
Zigu's all grown up now.

27:28.200 --> 27:31.520
After Mother died,
palace life became hard.

27:31.600 --> 27:34.640
Traps and murders were everywhere.

27:34.720 --> 27:38.040
Zigu and I had to tread carefully.

27:39.480 --> 27:42.840
People say being a Hostage Prince
in Great Yan is miserable.

27:43.560 --> 27:47.280
They don't know those
were the happiest days of my life.

27:48.480 --> 27:52.200
Although I was far from home
with all the hardships,

27:53.000 --> 27:55.080
there were still moments of joy.

27:55.680 --> 27:57.720
And the Emperor shared my vision.

28:00.080 --> 28:02.920
The Emperor cares for the people
and their lives.

28:04.160 --> 28:07.320
I hope that one day,
Xiyan can be like Great Yan.

28:10.920 --> 28:11.800
Yue Qin.

28:14.480 --> 28:16.800
You are more than just
the Prince Heir of Xiyan.

28:16.880 --> 28:18.240
You are you.

28:20.040 --> 28:24.040
Sometimes, you can let go of the rules.

28:24.120 --> 28:27.240
You can be free, just like Zigu.

28:28.760 --> 28:31.760
When we return to Xiyan,
let's go sledding together.

28:35.880 --> 28:39.320
INVITATION

28:39.400 --> 28:41.560
The Xiyan court sent an invitation.

28:41.640 --> 28:45.000
They heard about
the lamp-lighting ceremony in Qingzhou.

28:45.840 --> 28:47.400
Now that trade is flourishing
between our nations,

28:47.480 --> 28:50.800
a ceremony in Qingzhou
will symbolize lasting peace.

28:51.440 --> 28:54.280
How will the ceremony be conducted?

28:55.680 --> 28:57.880
By then, I will represent
Xiyan's Sun Kunlun

28:57.960 --> 29:00.240
and ascend the mountain from the west.

29:01.040 --> 29:02.680
Mei Lin will represent Great Yan's

29:02.760 --> 29:04.520
Moon Kunlun and ascend from the east.

29:05.120 --> 29:09.880
We must not touch the ground
during the ascent.

29:10.480 --> 29:12.640
We will be carried
by palanquin bearers to the summit,

29:13.280 --> 29:16.160
where we will offer prayers
and light the Longevity Lamp.

29:16.240 --> 29:17.200
Once the lamp is lit,
the ceremony will end.

29:19.280 --> 29:21.880
Very well. We will fully cooperate.

29:22.480 --> 29:23.840
Thank you, Your Excellency.

29:24.560 --> 29:27.240
After the ceremony,
we will return to Xiyan.

29:30.520 --> 29:34.040
By then, the Snow Dragon Whisker
should bloom.

29:34.120 --> 29:36.840
Prince Heir, do you remember our promise?

29:42.240 --> 29:43.560
This trip to Xiyan

29:43.640 --> 29:46.320
is for Mei Lin
to take the Snow Dragon Whisker.

29:52.280 --> 29:53.240
Farewell.

30:24.760 --> 30:25.920
My lord.

30:26.000 --> 30:29.560
The palanquin bearers for Princess Heir
have been arranged.

30:37.520 --> 30:40.200
The night wind is harsh.
Drinking will harm your health.

30:46.080 --> 30:46.960
After this parting,

30:49.160 --> 30:50.320
we may never

30:51.840 --> 30:53.640
meet again.

31:12.080 --> 31:13.080
Let's make a bet.

31:13.160 --> 31:15.040
If I grow Red Fruits,

31:15.120 --> 31:16.640
you will marry me.

31:19.440 --> 31:20.280
I won't bet.

31:20.920 --> 31:22.800
I won't be married off.
I'll just take a live-in husband.

31:22.880 --> 31:25.360
When we return to Qingzhou, we will marry.

31:25.440 --> 31:28.280
Qingzhou is so far away.
My father can't interfere.

31:30.560 --> 31:32.240
You need to first grow the Red Fruits.

31:50.840 --> 31:51.920
She's right.

31:54.520 --> 31:55.480
Red Fruit…

31:56.560 --> 31:59.440
Only in Laowozi Village,
they call it Red Fruit.

32:02.920 --> 32:04.320
I didn't believe it then.

32:07.000 --> 32:09.880
I thought I could grow one
with the same taste.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.520
Some things,

32:19.080 --> 32:21.280
if forced, turn bitter.

32:23.320 --> 32:27.920
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

32:28.000 --> 32:31.080
Even if we're far apart,
we can still write letters.

32:31.160 --> 32:34.400
When you're too busy
running a business with your lover,

32:34.480 --> 32:37.080
you'll forget about us.

32:37.160 --> 32:41.360
Who said it?
I'll write to you all the time.

32:41.440 --> 32:42.480
Don't get annoyed!

32:43.160 --> 32:44.360
Don't forget to write!

32:44.440 --> 32:45.520
Cheers!

33:17.600 --> 33:24.080
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

33:48.560 --> 33:49.560
Prince Heir.

33:53.360 --> 33:55.640
You're finally here!

33:56.680 --> 33:58.680
Princess Heir has had too much to drink.

33:58.760 --> 34:01.240
- Drank too much?
- Yes, too much.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.400
Sit down.

34:10.679 --> 34:13.840
When you're free
from the Princess Heir's constraints,

34:16.080 --> 34:18.480
I will give you this jade ring.

34:24.400 --> 34:27.000
QINGZHOU POST

34:27.080 --> 34:32.719
Tomorrow is the lamp-lighting ceremony.

34:32.800 --> 34:35.719
Rest assured,
our people have infiltrated the ranks.

34:35.800 --> 34:37.840
This ceremony will not succeed.

34:38.679 --> 34:40.960
If the lamp doesn't light,

34:41.560 --> 34:43.600
the King will be furious,

34:44.800 --> 34:47.480
and we'll strike

34:48.440 --> 34:52.960
to remove Yue Qin as the Prince Heir.

34:54.760 --> 34:56.480
General, our spies discovered
that the treasure

34:56.560 --> 34:59.160
brought back by the Prince Heir
is the Snow Dragon Whisker.

35:01.760 --> 35:03.240
Snow Dragon Whisker?

35:05.240 --> 35:09.440
That rare, precious herb?

35:28.400 --> 35:29.960
The auspicious hour has arrived.

35:30.040 --> 35:32.120
The Prince Heir has departed.
We should set out as well.

35:33.920 --> 35:34.800
Alright.

35:35.600 --> 35:38.440
The Moon Kunlun
ascends the Sacred Mountain.

36:07.680 --> 36:09.040
Is Princess Heir alright?

36:12.240 --> 36:13.760
How are you doing your job?

36:13.840 --> 36:15.560
The Moon Kunlun is blessed by the gods.

36:15.640 --> 36:17.080
She will reach the summit safely.

36:17.160 --> 36:19.560
Unless… Unless the gods reject her.

36:19.640 --> 36:21.640
The ceremony has never had such a mishap.

36:21.720 --> 36:23.160
How could she have fallen?

36:23.240 --> 36:25.640
She's from Great Yan.
The gods do not recognize her.

36:25.720 --> 36:26.960
If we force the ascent,

36:27.040 --> 36:28.640
we may anger the heavens.

36:28.720 --> 36:33.520
- Thank you, gods, for your guidance.
- Thank you, gods, for your guidance.

36:40.960 --> 36:43.360
Princess Heir,
your feet must not touch the ground.

36:43.440 --> 36:44.800
The auspicious hour must not be missed.

37:40.800 --> 37:42.120
The path may be long,

37:43.480 --> 37:44.720
but it has an end.

37:53.200 --> 37:54.680
Last time in the cave,

37:56.720 --> 37:58.560
you guided me.

37:59.560 --> 38:01.280
I should be thanking you.

38:11.000 --> 38:12.600
I already have my path.

38:15.400 --> 38:17.280
Why won't you move forward?

38:56.760 --> 38:59.120
Princess Heir, we've arrived.

39:38.160 --> 39:40.440
Princess Heir, the hour is near.

40:42.120 --> 40:45.680
Under the Sun and Moon's divine light,
may brilliance guide us.

40:46.360 --> 40:49.720
In the Sun and Moon's sovereign will,
let the oracle reveal its truth.

40:50.360 --> 40:53.360
Through their light,
may radiance shine upon the world.

40:56.360 --> 40:58.280
Divine light shines forth.

40:58.360 --> 40:59.480
Blessings descend.

41:00.160 --> 41:01.960
Divine light shines forth.

41:02.040 --> 41:04.200
Blessings descend.
